        "id": "flask/sansio/scaffold.py::function::find_package::29169",
        "kind": "function",
        "explain": "Determines the install prefix for a package and the sys.path-style directory it is imported from. Calls _find_package_path(import_name), compares against the absolute sys.prefix: if the package path is relative to the prefix, returns (prefix, package_path) as the system-installed case. Otherwise splits the path; if the last folder is 'site-packages' (case-insensitive), distinguishes Windows layout (prefix/lib/site-packages \u2192 return parent of lib), Unix layout (parent's basename is 'lib' \u2192 return grandparent), or another layout (prefix/site-packages \u2192 return site_parent), each paired with package_path. If none of these match, the package is assumed not installed and (None, package_path) is returned.",
